OL,3,GNEWSARobbie Butler to be new health
OL,4,Aminister
OL,5,
OL,6,FLagan Valley Ulster Unionist assembly
OL,7,Fmember (MLA) Robbie Butler is to become
OL,8,Fthe new health minister, BBC News NI
OL,9,Funderstands.
OL,11,FHis appointment comes after Mike
OL,12,FNesbitt resigned as health minister
OL,13,Fafter his party leader Jon Burrows told
OL,14,Fa town hall meeting that he did not
OL,15,Fsupport emergency general surgery (EGS)
OL,16,Fbeing removed from Causeway Hospital.
OL,18,FOn Monday, Burrows said he was
OL,19,Fdisappointed by Nesbitt's decision to
OL,20,Fquit and said he would decide
OL,21,F"overnight" who would replace him.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
